{"id":"leetcode-1137","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"N-th Tribonacci Number","summary":"The Tribonacci sequence is defined by T0 = 0, T1 = 1, T2 = 1, and for n >= 0, Tn+3 equals the sum of Tn, Tn+1, and Tn+2.","statement":"The Tribonacci sequence is defined by T0 = 0, T1 = 1, T2 = 1, and for n >= 0, Tn+3 equals the sum of Tn, Tn+1, and Tn+2. Given an index n, provide the corresponding Tribonacci number Tn.","constraints":["T0=0,T1=T2=1 and each later term sums the previous three.","Return Tn."],"topics":["dynamic-programming","math"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"tribonacci_number","parameters":[{"name":"n","annotation":"int","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"int","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def tribonacci_number(n: int) -> int:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def tribonacci_number(n):\n if n<2:return n\n a,b,c=0,1,1\n for _ in range(3,n+1):a,b,c=b,c,a+b+c\n return c\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def tribonacci_number(n):\n if n<2:return n\n a,b,c=0,1,1\n for _ in range(3,n+1):a,b,c=b,c,b+c\n return c\n","def tribonacci_number(n):\n if n<3:return n\n a,b,c=0,1,1\n for _ in range(3,n+1):a,b,c=b,c,a+b+c\n return c\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n)","target_space_complexity":"O(1)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Only the previous three terms are needed.","Handle n zero and one directly; initialize 0,1,1.","Rotate the triple while appending their sum through index n.","The variables maintain exactly T(i-2),T(i-1),T(i) after each iteration."],"editorial":"The variables maintain exactly T(i-2),T(i-1),T(i) after each iteration.","tests":[{"id":"lc-1137-1","arguments":[4],"expected":4,"comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"Values 0,1,1,2,4 gi